<urn:atm:triage:finding/BOUNDARY-X234-PROD-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BOUNDARY-X234-PROD-001" ;
  triage:title "atm CLI directly depends on atm-rusqlite in [dependencies]" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm/Cargo.toml:25 — atm-rusqlite added to [dependencies] (production). Fires 7 boundary rules (BOUNDARY-ClientTransport-CLI + 6 MailStore/RosterStore/etc). atm CLI must not depend on atm-rusqlite directly — access SQLite only through boundary adapters. Introduced by commit 4cfeb8c. Open on X.2/X.3/X.4." ;
